{"channelId":"UC4kk2JjVqIsC_NRfkmtGmLg","row":["Wetheriggs Animal Rescue",15,"Wetheriggs is a small animal rescue centre based at Thorpe Farm near Barnard Castle in County Durham, UK. We are open every day from 10am to public and just ask for a small admission fee to support our rescue work. Visitors can get close to our animals and feed a lot of them. We often have animal handling sessions with small furries, chicks, ducklings, reptiles and more. We are a registered UK charity (1131536) and depend on public support to keep running. Come and check us out www.wetheriggs.co.uk","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC4kk2JjVqIsC_NRfkmtGmLg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC4kk2JjVqIsC_NRfkmtGmLg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:39.644Z","channelId":"UC4kk2JjVqIsC_NRfkmtGmLg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"30be5d53b88cb4b284807b4bb8a53fc998f93717734c10813b7bc9ab1a0f10fd","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"68e13cb064e899367800bd008d8d8a21292542e5c5807cb36b1c7f49d6a8a018"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC4kk2JjVqIsC_NRfkmtGmLg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":15,"raw":"15 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC4kk2JjVqIsC_NRfkmtGmLg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:39.644Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC4kk2JjVqIsC_NRfkmtGmLg"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"keep","code":"biography_audience_admitted","reason":"完整主频道简介与保存的采集原文一致，命中本人／团队／服务语境；职业资质仍未核验。","keywords":["animal rescue"],"role":"undetermined","excerpt":"Wetheriggs is a small animal rescue centre based at Thorpe Farm near Barnard Castle in County Durham, UK. We are open every d